      "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"studio:contract\" content=\"v0\">\n  <meta name=\"studio:format\" content=\"1080x1350\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/brand/brand.css\">\n  <style>\n    [data-artboard] { position: relative; background: var(--color-paper); }\n    [data-artboard] > [data-layer] { position: absolute; }\n    [data-type=\"text\"] { hyphens: none; }\n\n    /* label band with raised centre tab (pack quote) */\n    .band { background: var(--color-green); }\n    .band-tab { background: var(--color-green); border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0; }\n\n    /* intro stack: eyebrow + rule, display headline, subhead */\n    .intro { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-24); }\n    .eyebrow-stack { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: var(--space-16); }\n    .eyebrow { color: var(--color-green-deep); white-space: nowrap; }\n    .rule { margin: 0; width: 56px; height: 6px; background: var(--color-green); }\n    .headline {\n      font-family: var(--font-display);\n      font-size: 88px;\n      font-weight: 900;\n      font-stretch: 125%;\n      font-style: italic;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n      line-height: 1;\n      color: var(--color-ink);\n      text-wrap: balance;\n    }\n    .subhead { font-weight: 500; color: var(--color-graphite); }\n\n    /* hexagon element badges: shape + letter stacked in one grid cell */\n    .badge { display: grid; place-items: center; }\n    .badge > * { grid-area: 1 / 1; }\n    .hex { width: 120px; height: 104px; clip-path: polygon(25% 0, 75% 0, 100% 50%, 75% 100%, 25% 100%, 0 50%); }\n    .hex-b { background: var(--color-amber); }\n    .hex-zn { background: var(--color-green); }\n    .badge-letter {\n      font-family: var(--font-text);\n      font-size: 44px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      line-height: 1;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n      color: var(--color-ink);\n    }\n\n    /* sign-off */\n    .sign-off { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }\n    .sign-off-logo { width: 248px; height: 40px; }\n    .web {\n      font-family: var(--font-text);\n      font-size: 28px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      line-height: 1.3;\n      letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n      color: var(--color-graphite);\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main data-artboard style=\"width:1080px;height:1350px\">\n\n    <img data-layer=\"product-photo\" data-type=\"image\"\n         src=\"/brand/assets/product-venta-borinc.png\" alt=\"Venta Borinc ambalajı\"\n         style=\"left:108px; top:200px; width:1160px; height:1160px\">\n\n    <div data-layer=\"label-band\" data-type=\"shape\" data-role=\"decoration\" class=\"band\"\n         style=\"left:0; top:1326px; width:1080px; height:24px\"></div>\n    <div data-layer=\"label-band-tab\" data-type=\"shape\" data-role=\"decoration\" class=\"band-tab\"\n         style=\"left:444px; top:1302px; width:192px; height:32px\"></div>\n\n    <div data-layer=\"intro\" data-type=\"group\" class=\"intro\"\n         style=\"left:72px; top:72px; width:936px\">\n      <div data-layer=\"eyebrow-stack\" data-type=\"group\" class=\"eyebrow-stack\">\n        <p data-layer=\"eyebrow\" data-type=\"text\" data-role=\"eyebrow\" class=\"ts-eyebrow eyebrow\">VENTA BORINC</p>\n        <div data-layer=\"eyebrow-rule\" data-type=\"shape\" data-role=\"decoration\" class=\"brand-rule rule\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <h1 data-layer=\"headline\" data-type=\"text\" data-role=\"headline\" class=\"ts-display-m headline\">Bor ve çinko<br>bir arada</h1>\n      <p data-layer=\"subhead\" data-type=\"text\" data-role=\"subhead\" class=\"ts-body subhead\">Mikro bitki besin maddeleri karışımı.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div data-layer=\"badge-b\" data-type=\"group\" class=\"badge\"\n         style=\"left:72px; top:720px; width:120px; height:104px\">\n      <div data-layer=\"badge-b-hex\" data-type=\"shape\" data-role=\"badge\" class=\"hex hex-b\"></div>\n      <p data-layer=\"badge-b-letter\" data-type=\"text\" data-role=\"badge\" class=\"badge-letter\">B</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div data-layer=\"badge-zn\" data-type=\"group\" class=\"badge\"\n         style=\"left:168px; top:776px; width:120px; height:104px\">\n      <div data-layer=\"badge-zn-hex\" data-type=\"shape\" data-role=\"badge\" class=\"hex hex-zn\"></div>\n      <p data-layer=\"badge-zn-letter\" data-type=\"text\" data-role=\"badge\" class=\"badge-letter\">Zn</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div data-layer=\"sign-off\" data-type=\"group\" class=\"sign-off\"\n         style=\"left:72px; top:1232px; width:936px; height:48px\">\n      <img data-layer=\"logo-venta\" data-type=\"logo\" class=\"sign-off-logo\"\n           src=\"/brand/logos/venta-wordmark-black.standin.png\" alt=\"VENTA\">\n      <p data-layer=\"web\" data-type=\"text\" data-role=\"cta\" class=\"ts-caption web\">www.mtmagro.com</p>\n    </div>\n\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
    }
  ],
  "caption": "Bor ve çinko, Venta Borinc'de bir arada.\n\nVenta Borinc; bor (B) ve çinko (Zn-sülfat) içeren bir mikro bitki besin maddeleri karışımıdır. Ambalajdaki B ve Zn altıgen rozetleri de bu iki elementi işaret eder.\n\nÜrünün toprak ve/veya yaprak analizi yaptırılarak kullanılması tavsiye edilir. Kullanmadan önce etiketi okuyunuz.\n\nDetaylı bilgi: www.mtmagro.com\n\n#Venta #MTMAgro #Borinc #Bor #Çinko #BitkiBesleme",
  "rationale": "The idea is the pack's own story, two elements in one bag: the real Venta Borinc bag is the single focal point at about 56% of the artboard height, right-aligned to the margin on white, while the B and Zn hexagons from the label form a honeycomb pair on its left that leads the eye into it. A wide black italic display-caps headline (BOR VE ÇİNKO / BİR ARADA) quotes the VENTA logotype, and the bottom closes with the green label band and raised centre tab plus the VENTA logo and www.mtmagro.com sign-off. The badge letters are set in ink rather than the pack's white, because white on amber (about 2.2:1) and on green (about 2.7:1) fails the 3:1 contrast rule; BORINC is typed in capitals so that lang=tr uppercasing cannot turn it into BORİNC. No numbers, doses or benefits are stated; everything on the image comes from facts.json.",
